\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1029575,\"title\":\"The Family Plan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jLLtx3nTRSLGPAKl4RoIv1FbEBr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/arNhhBd88bP3Bjoe4HT8MFE1JQA.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Dan Morgan is many things: a devoted husband, a loving father, a celebrated car salesman. He's also a former assassin. And when his past catches up to his present, he's forced to take his unsuspecting family on a road trip unlike any other.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1011985,\"title\":\"Kung Fu Panda 4\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kDp1vUBnMpe8ak4rjgl3cLELqjU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3ffPx9jqg0yj9y1KWeagT7D20CB.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Po is gearing up to become the spiritual leader of his Valley of Peace, but also needs someone to take his place as Dragon Warrior. As such, he will train a new kung fu practitioner for the spot and will encounter a villain called the Chameleon who conjures villains from the past.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":98566,\"title\":\"Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/azL2ThbJMIkts3ZMt3j1YgBUeDB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eezsbzYPbYKjjh6E1XHDBNlLynh.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a kingpin threatens New York City, a group of mutated turtle warriors must emerge from the shadows to protect their home.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":384018,\"title\":\"Fast & Furious Presents: Hobbs & Shaw\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qRyy2UmjC5ur9bDi3kpNNRCc5nc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hpgda6P9GutvdkDX5MUJ92QG9aj.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ever since US Diplomatic Security Service Agent Hobbs and lawless outcast Shaw first faced off, they just have traded smack talk and body blows. But when cyber-genetically enhanced anarchist Brixton's ruthless actions threaten the future of humanity, they join forces to defeat him.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1175942,\"title\":\"The Bad Guys 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/26oSPnq0ct59l07QOXZKyzsiRtN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jvpkBenB6hv19WWYVlaiow8zklq.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The now-reformed Bad Guys are trying (very, very hard) to be good, but instead find themselves hijacked into a high-stakes, globe-trotting heist, masterminded by a new team of criminals they never saw coming: The Bad Girls.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":417859,\"title\":\"Puss in Boots\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7a5Jzjr9TmffGy76y1SZhn3sCiz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c5MCkebYhFuhmi32x760HfcvLIO.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Long before he even met Shrek, the notorious fighter, lover and outlaw Puss in Boots becomes a hero when he sets off on an adventure with the tough and street smart Kitty Softpaws and the mastermind Humpty Dumpty to save his town. This is the true story of The Cat, The Myth, The Legend... The Boots.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":287986,\"title\":\"Hudugaru\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aoIN7VeKoVuVxUGEKuKFvL4fYYL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9w7GAFCxpuxBguwRk9bJX0fofta.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story revolves around three friends who are desperately looking out for suitable job opportunities. Their lives get devastated when they try to unite two lovers.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"7xfqITrMDcI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}